{"title":"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/1/9818f1229b2aadc9098258cebc15d62da3f6ebbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X=\\frac{1}{2007 \\sqrt{2006}+2006 \\sqrt{2007}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"241\" height=\"41\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/6/b46af03ef19094653b20d8680cd77316351efd54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2006}}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2007}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"170\" height=\"41\" />, which of the following is correct?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/5/495c603e94f3d97142aa00b6f51e839bc224f67c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } X=2Y\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } Y=2X\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } X=Y\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } X=Y^2\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } Y=X^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"605\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/1/e61d2ce8f530cf82ce4a56f5686bab878f7b0a0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 2007,\\ b = 2006$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"151\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/9/3c984c90df5fcddf0fbe53f3a0a03558494ffa00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X = \\frac{1}{a\\sqrt{b} + b\\sqrt{a}} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{a\\sqrt{b} - b\\sqrt{a}}{a\\sqrt{b} - b\\sqrt{a}}\\right) = \\frac{a\\sqrt{b} - b\\sqrt{a}}{ab(a-b)} = \\frac{a\\sqrt{b} - b\\sqrt{a}}{ab} = \\frac{\\sqrt{b}}{b} - \\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{a} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{b}} - \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a}} = Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"738\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/1/6c1e668abb34def15dd0ee14bccc10bb5efcb801.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X=Y\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"107\" height=\"13\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2007 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_10\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_12\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1\">1